    {
      "type": "discussion",
      "content": "For practical reasons, we have expressed properties 1 – 6 in terms of the estimators $a$, $b$, $\\operatorname{Cov}(x,y)$, and $\\operatorname{Var}(x)$. They also hold when the estimators are replaced by the true parameters $\\alpha$, $\\beta$, $\\sigma(x,y)$, and $\\sigma^{2}(x)$.",
